  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Ol' Slewfoot** (1 review): Listener never expected to hear anyone cover this song again, and has long kept a Bobby Slewfoot version on their phone [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Morning Light**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 14 archived performances [4]\n- **Clinch Mountain Back-Step**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 11 archived performances [4]\n- **Sweet Revenge**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [4]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Fire On My Tongue, Know It All, Running The Route, Red Daisy, *Hide And Seek [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2021-03-20** (recommended): source not stated; 20 songs; 135 min; rated 4.5/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: Listener says the recording sounds great [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Taper recorded from Section 202, Row X, Seat 126, with microphones held 6.5 feet high [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2021-03-20**: taped by Z-Man; transferred by Z-Man; source: Schoeps CCM4V'S>Lunatec V2>Sound Devices 722 (24/44.1) [1]. Also: Recorded by Z-Man with Schoeps CCM4V microphones into a Lunatec V2 and Sound Devices 722 at 24-bit/44.1kHz, then converted to 16-bit FLAC [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings St. Augustine Amphitheatre - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/venue/the-st-augustine-amphitheatre/) [5]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings St. Augustine Amphitheatre - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/venue/the-st-augustine-amphitheatre/) [6]\n- Poster by thecurtainwithblog.blogspot.com: [Billy Strings - 2021-03-20 The St. Augustine Amphitheatre, St. Augustine, FL](https://thecurtainwithblog.blogspot.com/2021/04/billy-strings-2021-03-24-tipitinas-new.html) [7]",
